  "abstract": "MATLAB code, authorized published average records, saved learning states, predictions, results and figures for task-incremental and class-incremental comparisons. Five saved Simulink inference banks reproduce all 47,502 accepted source-record decisions across 2,610 logical evaluation populations without retraining. This is numerical implementation parity, not independent physical validation. Original code is MIT; authored scientific artifacts are CC BY 4.0 within the authors rights, subject to LICENSE_SCOPE.json and retained source-specific notices.",
